{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Prometheus datasource for Flink metrics (when available after Phase 6 deployment)",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": "-- Grafana --",
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "FSI Kafka Platform",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "FSI Kafka Platform - Flink Jobs monitoring. Stub dashboard -- Flink metrics will be available after Phase 6 deployment. This dashboard shows placeholder structure for running jobs, checkpoint duration, backpressure, and throughput.",
  "editable": true,
  "gnetId": null,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Running Flink Jobs",
      "description": "Flink metrics will be available after Phase 6 deployment. This panel shows placeholder structure.",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(flink_jobmanager_job_uptime > 0)",
          "legendFormat": "Running Jobs",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "#6B7280", "value": null },
              { "color": "#22C55E", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No data available. Verify metrics export is configured and the target cluster is reachable."
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Checkpoint Duration",
      "description": "Flink metrics will be available after Phase 6 deployment. This panel shows placeholder structure.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 18, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flink_taskmanager_job_task_checkpointAlignmentTime{job_name=~\".*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job_name}} - {{task_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "noValue": "No data available. Verify metrics export is configured and the target cluster is reachable."
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Backpressure",
      "description": "Flink metrics will be available after Phase 6 deployment. This panel shows placeholder structure.",
      "type": "gauge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(flink_taskmanager_job_task_backPressuredTimeMsPerSecond{job_name=~\".*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Max Backpressure",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "#6B7280", "value": null },
              { "color": "#22C55E", "value": 0 },
              { "color": "#EAB308", "value": 100 },
              { "color": "#EF4444", "value": 500 }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1000,
          "noValue": "No data available. Verify metrics export is configured and the target cluster is reachable."
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "showThresholdLabels": true,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Throughput (Records/sec)",
      "description": "Flink metrics will be available after Phase 6 deployment. This panel shows placeholder structure.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flink_taskmanager_job_task_numRecordsOutPerSecond{job_name=~\".*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job_name}} - {{task_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "noValue": "No data available. Verify metrics export is configured and the target cluster is reachable."
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Flink Stub Notice",
      "description": "Information about Phase 6 wiring.",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Flink Jobs Dashboard - Stub\n\nThis dashboard is a **placeholder structure** for Flink job monitoring. Flink metrics will be available after **Phase 6** deployment.\n\nMetrics wired in Phase 6:\n- `flink_jobmanager_job_uptime` -- Job uptime\n- `flink_taskmanager_job_task_checkpointAlignmentTime` -- Checkpoint alignment time\n- `flink_taskmanager_job_task_backPressuredTimeMsPerSecond` -- Backpressure\n- `flink_taskmanager_job_task_numRecordsOutPerSecond` -- Output throughput\n\nSee `observability/metrics-mapping.md` for cross-provider query equivalents."
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["fsi-kafka", "flink-jobs", "observability", "stub"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "CLUSTER_ID",
        "label": "Cluster ID",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "value": "" },
        "options": [],
        "description": "Target Kafka cluster ID"
      },
      {
        "name": "DOMAIN_PREFIX",
        "label": "Domain",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "value": "*" },
        "options": [],
        "description": "Topic domain filter pattern"
      },
      {
        "name": "ENVIRONMENT",
        "label": "Environment",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "value": "prod" },
        "options": [],
        "description": "Environment label"
      },
      {
        "name": "SLA_TIER",
        "label": "SLA Tier",
        "type": "custom",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": { "value": ["critical", "standard", "best-effort", "compliance"] },
        "options": [
          { "text": "critical", "value": "critical", "selected": true },
          { "text": "standard", "value": "standard", "selected": true },
          { "text": "best-effort", "value": "best-effort", "selected": true },
          { "text": "compliance", "value": "compliance", "selected": true }
        ],
        "description": "Filter by SLA tier"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "FSI Kafka - Flink Jobs",
  "uid": "fsi-kafka-flink-jobs",
  "version": 1
}
